([CASE STUDY 2: Feedback Capture Matrix for a Smart Irrigation App]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: A smart agriculture mobile app was tested with 12 smallholder farmers) Tj
T*
(in Punjab.) Tj
T*
(Feedback Capture Matrix Results:) Tj
T*
(- Likes \(+\): Clean visual icons for soil moisture; one-tap emergency pump shutoff.) Tj
T*
(- Criticisms \(Delta\): Font size too small to read under direct bright sunlight; app) Tj
T*
(crashed when mobile data connection dropped.) Tj
T*
(- Questions \(?\): 'What does pH 6.8 mean for wheat?' 'Does the water schedule adjust if) Tj
T*
(it rains tonight?') Tj
T*
(- Ideas \(!\): Add local voice audio instructions in Punjabi; integrate rainfall radar) Tj
T*
(forecasts automatically.) Tj
T*
(Iteration Decisions: Implemented high-contrast sunlight display mode, local Punjabi) Tj
T*
(voice prompts, and automated offline moisture caching.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
([CASE STUDY 3: Customer Journey Map for Electric Vehicle Charging]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: EV drivers reported charging anxiety and frustrating charging station) Tj
T*
(experiences.) Tj
T*
(Customer Journey Mapping Across 5 Stages:) Tj
T*
(1. Route Planning: User searches for charging station on mobile app. \(Sentiment:) Tj
T*
(Neutral\).) Tj
T*
(2. Arrival: Finds charging bay blocked by gasoline vehicle or station out of order.) Tj
T*
(\(Sentiment: Intense Anger - Major Pain Point!\).) Tj
T*
(3. Plugin & Authentication: Required downloading a proprietary third-party app and) Tj
T*
(entering credit card manually in the rain. \(Sentiment: High Frustration\).) Tj
T*
(4. Charging: Waited 45 minutes with no indoor shelter or amenities nearby. \(Sentiment:) Tj
T*
(Boredom\).) Tj
T*
(5. Payment: Received billing receipt without kWh consumption breakdown. \(Sentiment:) Tj
T*
(Mistrust\).) Tj
T*
(Redesign Intervention: Implemented Plug-and-Charge ISO 15118 \(automatic vehicle) Tj
T*
(authentication on cable insertion\) and live bay camera occupancy detection.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
