(accessibility standards for visually impaired and elderly residents.) Tj
T*
(Audit Discoveries & WCAG 2.1 Remediations:) Tj
T*
(- Perceivable: Gray text on light gray background failed 4.5:1 contrast ratio. Replaced) Tj
T*
(with 7:1 high-contrast palette.) Tj
T*
(- Operable: Forms could only be submitted via mouse click. Restructured DOM tab-indexes) Tj
T*
(for complete keyboard-only navigation.) Tj
T*
(- Understandable: Complex legal notices were rewritten in plain Grade 6 English with) Tj
T*
(screen-reader friendly ARIA labels.) Tj
T*
(- Robust: All public service forms were refactored to support screen readers \(NVDA,) Tj
T*
(JAWS\) and mobile assistive voiceover.) Tj
T*
(Outcome: Portal achieved full WCAG AAA certification; citizen online tax filing) Tj
T*
(increased by 42%.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 5.5 University Review & Examination Questions) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Q1: Explain the 'Show, Don't Tell' philosophy of user testing, illustrating how a) Tj
T*
(facilitator should handle a user struggling with a prototype.) Tj
T*
(Answer: 'Show, Don't Tell' asserts that a prototype should communicate its own) Tj
T*
(functionality without external defense or explanation from the design team. The) Tj
T*
(objective of testing is not to prove that the prototype works, but to discover where and) Tj
T*
(why the design fails to match the user's natural mental model. When a user stumbles or) Tj
T*
(makes an error, the facilitator must resist the impulse to intervene or guide them.) Tj
T*
(Instead, the facilitator remains silent or gently prompts: 'I see you hesitated there;) Tj
T*
(what were you expecting to happen?' Documenting where the user gets stuck provides the) Tj
T*
(raw data needed to redesign the interface.) Tj
T*
(* Q2: Enumerate five of Jakob Nielsen's Usability Heuristics, providing concrete) Tj
T*
(examples of UI designs that violate and satisfy each.) Tj
T*
(Answer: \(1\) Visibility of System Status: Violation - clicking a button causes a freeze) Tj
T*
(with no indicator; Satisfied - animated loading spinner and progress bar. \(2\) Match) Tj
T*
(between System and Real World: Violation - clinical software showing error code) Tj
T*
('ERR_0x882'; Satisfied - plain English message 'Invalid patient dosage'. \(3\) User) Tj
T*
(Control and Freedom: Violation - no cancel button during long upload; Satisfied -) Tj
T*
(prominent 'Cancel' and 'Undo' buttons. \(4\) Error Prevention: Violation - allowing users) Tj
T*
(to book airline tickets with departure dates after return dates; Satisfied - calendar) Tj
T*
(greyouts preventing invalid date selection. \(5\) Recognition over Recall: Violation -) Tj
T*
(requiring users to remember previously typed SKU numbers; Satisfied - autocomplete) Tj
T*
(search dropdown displaying product image and name.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 5.6 Key Takeaways and Revision Points) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
ET

